Package: alx-branding
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: SDDM theme, PNG wallpapers, Calamares branding, and welcome for ALX Lite
 Provides original PNG ASCII ALX wallpapers (1024x768, 1280x720, 1366x768,
 1920x1080), the minimal GPU-free SDDM QML theme (/usr/share/sddm/themes/alx),
 /etc/sddm.conf.d/alx.conf, Calamares branding and slideshow, and the
 first-boot terminal welcome script.
